    "body": "I noticed that for multiple custom sections the  time took for testing is piling up and causing long delays.\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[custom.ssh]\r\nwhen = 'test -n \"$SSH_CLIENT\" && test \"$USER\" != \"root\"'\r\nformat = \"[ $symbol $output ]($style)\"\r\ncommand = \"echo $USER@$(uname -n)\"\r\nstyle = \"bg:#FD7208 fg:bright-white\"\r\nsymbol = \"⌁\"\r\n[custom.ssh_root]\r\nwhen = 'test -n \"$SSH_CLIENT\" && test \"$USER\" = \"root\"'\r\nformat = \"[ $symbol $output ]($style)\"\r\ncommand = \"echo $USER@$(uname -n)\"\r\nstyle = \"bg:purple fg:bright-white\"\r\nsymbol = \"⌁\"\r\n[custom.local_root]\r\nwhen = '[[ -z \"$SSH_CLIENT\" ]] && [[ \"$USER\" = \"root\" ]]'\r\nformat = \"[ $output ]($style)\"\r\ncommand = \"echo $USER\"\r\nstyle = \"bg:purple fg:bright-white\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nEvent tho under normal conditions none of those sections eval to true, they are causing much delay.\r\nSo maybe the command execution is not even the problem here, but the way the tests are executed could be optimised.",
