    "updated_at": "2020-10-13T19:45:58Z",
    "body": "Given the length of your shell config, the module is likely slow due to the startup time of your shell profile.\r\nThe custom command module runs the provided command in a shell instance, which is susceptible to being slowed down by your shell config.\r\n\r\nConsider using the `shell` property in custom commands to specify another shell, or add flags to allow your shell to ignore startup files(e.g. `-d` and `-f` for zsh).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
